		{
			dependencies: ["2070C70B2AB53F23"]
			description: [
				"&e神话挑战是限时击败特定首领的终局副本挑战。"
				""
				"&7阅读下一页，了解神话挑战的具体运作方式。"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&l升级你的沙漏（Hourglass）"
				""
				"&7每个首领都有一个击败时限，时限分为3个阶段。"
				""
				"&7First part will be at roughly 17% of the total time, if you defeat the boss at that time, it will upgrade &e3 levels&7, then between 18% and 66%, it will upgrade &e2 levels&7 when defeated, and finally from 67% onwards it will upgrade only one level. If you run out of time, the &echallenge will be stopped&7 and you will lose, your hourglass will also be &edowngraded by one level&7."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&l前缀与后缀"
				""
				"&7它们最多包含三个随机的&e附加效果&7，会改变战斗方式，比如添加修饰符、生成额外敌人或更改机制。"
				""
				"&7所有挑战中首个前缀已解锁，包含Tier I前缀。"
				"&7第二个后缀是 Tier II，在 +10 后解锁。"
				"&7第三个词缀是 Tier III，在 +16 后解锁。"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&l过期时间"
				""
				"&7Every hourglass resets on Fridays, so for example a +15 hourglass will turn back into +1 every friday."
				""
				"&7At the end of each hourglass you will see your currently weekly record."
				""
				"&7升级取决于你如何"
			]
			id: "3030011D88FE9091"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "16288B501F79A4DB"
					type: "xp_levels"
					xp_levels: 5
				}
